  lib_binding_lib.adam - the lib of lib_binding (PLAN-ADAM MO1b0 d): built
  only; its build writes the binding unit lib_binding_lib.adam beside its
  C header: consts of every literal kind (escaped text, a float32, INT64_MIN,
  a value past int64, a choices value, an array, record and set literal),
  a choices type, a set, a record, a packed record of bitfields, a record
  with an inline overlay, an array, a pointer and a routine type, an
  interface, an object (a hidden field, init, done, a virtual, an overloaded
  pair, a field-bound property, a property with body accessors), a managed
  variable, routines (an overloaded cpplink pair, a routine-typed parameter,
  a dynamic array result, a parameter of an imported unit's type),
  and initialize / finalize (its machinery symbols keyed apart from the
  binding unit's of the same name: MO1b0 d1)
